file: data-validation.md
consumers: [GreatVibe users, Mochi agents]
produces: [data validation checklist]
---
# Purpose
Helps users validate required fields, accepted values, dates, numbers, and
duplicates before relying on a dataset.

# Key Sections
- Before validating data.
- Required fields.
- Accepted values.
- Date checks.
- Number checks.
- Duplicate checks.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Validation identifies risk; it does not prove business correctness unless the
  user supplies the relevant rules.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
